Subject: [PATCH 5.17 274/343] mmmremap.c: avoid pointless invalidate_range_start/end on mremap(old_size=0)
Date:   Tue, 12 Apr 2022 08:31:32 +0200
Message-Id: <20220412062959.231328521@linuxfoundation.org>
